  {
   "id": 4333,
   "hub_id": 9763,
   "version": "2.0.1",
   "description": "<p><strong>SPT-AKI 3.8.1, 3.8.2, 3.8.3</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Additions</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Added a new option to the GUI Zone creation tool - Any Zones added by the loader can now be loaded back into the creation tool. This should assist modders with altering, fixing or viewing their already existing zones.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>(If you downloaded this and it had issues extracting, it’s because it was compressed with 7zip and the windows extraction tool doesn’t like it. I have fixed the download zip to counter this)</em></p>\n",
   "link": "https://sp-mod.com/mod/download/649/virtuals-custom-quest-loader/2.0.1",
   "content_length": null,
   "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.3",
