   "hub_id": 10523,
   "version": "2.0.2",
   "description": "<p><strong>SPT 3.9.x</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Changes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Changed the way rotations are stored. They are now actually used when zones are created. Any zone with existing rotation values will need to be added back into the GUI editor and redone.</li>\n<li>Updated to 3.9.x</li>\n</ul>\n",
